Licensing of the valkey/ workload
=================================

Material derived from Valkey (and the Redis code it was forked from): the
injection patches (bugs/*/injection.patch, patches/), the reproducers
(repro.sh, expected outputs), and the Valkey test case names and commit
messages quoted in oracle.json and meta.json. It is derived from Valkey's
source and test suite and is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause licenses below.
Code from before Valkey's 2024 fork is under License 2 (Redis Ltd.); later
code is under License 1 (Valkey contributors).

Everything else in this directory (the bin/ scripts, the README, and the
labels and verification records in meta.json, oracle.json, NOTES.md and
RATIONALE.md) is Copyright Datadog, Inc. and licensed under the Apache License
2.0 (../LICENSE).

The following is Valkey's COPYING at 9.0.7
(https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey/blob/9.0.7/COPYING), verbatim:

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

